---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Pranav Magdum.">

	<section class="about-hero">
		<div class="about-hero-inner">
			<p class="hero-kicker">About</p>
			<h1>About</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="about-body">
		<div class="about-content">
			<p>I'm Pranav, a student at IISER Pune studying physics.</p>
			<p>Most of my time ends up somewhere around physics, mathematics, and computation. Lately I've been spending a lot of time thinking about particle physics, theorem proving, machine learning, reinforcement learning, and world models.</p>
			<p>I like learning things by going down rabbit holes and usually end up somewhere I didn't expect to.</p>
			<p>Outside of that, I read, watch movies, sketch, and occasionally spend far too much time on some completely random topic.</p>
			<p>This website is basically a place to keep track of some of those things.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.about-hero {
		padding: 4.25rem 0 2.75rem;
	}

	.about-hero-inner {
		max-width: 56rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2.5rem;
	}

	.about-body {
		padding: 0 0 4rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		max-width: 40rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2.5rem;
	}

	.about-content p {
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.about-content p + p {
		margin-top: 1.2em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 40rem) {
		.about-hero-inner,
		.about-content {
			padding: 0 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
